Package: glinty
Type: Package
Title: Tiny Reactive Web Application Framework
Version: 0.1.0.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Build interactive web applications in R with a pure base R
    reactive engine, an HTML tag builder, and a built-in HTTP and
    'WebSocket' server implemented on base R sockets. Session-scoped
    inputs, outputs, observers, and reactive expressions, with a small
    hand-written JavaScript client and no build tools.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cornball-ai/glinty
BugReports: https://github.com/cornball-ai/glinty/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    digest,
    grDevices,
    jsonlite,
    tools
Suggests:
    tinytest
Encoding: UTF-8
